  "term": "cutting",
  "definition": "In this source, cutting refers to self-cutting, a behavior often viewed clinically as a symptom to stop. The packet indicates that it may serve symbolic, emotion-regulating, and relationship-related functions, so stopping it can be experienced in complex ways rather than simply as straightforward recovery.",
